/* Table 5 -- the unbounded shadow HBT against the real 256-entry 8-way table.  A branch
   the shadow calls H2P and the real table does not is one the real table lost to a
   conflict: the false-negative bound of anything gated on H2P status. */
DEF_STAT(BRANCH_STATE_SHADOW_DECAYS, COUNT, NO_RATIO)
